{"id":202,"date":"2014-03-06T20:22:59","date_gmt":"2014-03-06T20:22:59","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/?p=202"},"modified":"2026-05-22T19:34:17","modified_gmt":"2026-05-22T19:34:17","slug":"gloss-com","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2014\/03\/06\/gloss-com\/","title":{"rendered":"Gloss.com"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\">Gloss.com<\/h1>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Role:<\/strong> Freelance Designer <strong>Scope:<\/strong> Email Marketing Design <strong>Client:<\/strong> Gloss.com (Est\u00e9e Lauder)<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Overview<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Gloss.com was a dedicated e-commerce and editorial destination for Est\u00e9e Lauder, one of the world&#8217;s most prestigious beauty conglomerates. The platform offered a curated digital shopping experience for prestige beauty \u2014 skincare, makeup, and fragrance across Est\u00e9e Lauder&#8217;s portfolio of brands.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">The Work<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">As a freelance designer, I was brought in to design marketing email campaigns for Gloss.com \u2014 translating the brand&#8217;s premium aesthetic into digital communications that drove engagement and purchase.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Working within the visual standards of an Est\u00e9e Lauder property meant delivering polished, high-end creative that met the expectations of a sophisticated beauty customer. Every email had to feel luxurious, on-brand, and shoppable.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Note<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Gloss.com is no longer active, having since been folded back into Est\u00e9e Lauder&#8217;s broader digital ecosystem \u2014 but the work represents experience designing for one of the most respected names in global beauty retail.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Disciplines<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Email Design \u00b7 Freelance Creative \u00b7 Beauty &amp; Retail Marketing \u00b7 Digital Campaign Design<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"207\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2014\/03\/06\/gloss-com\/gloss_staff_picks-2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"478,986\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"Gloss_staff_picks\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks.jpg\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-207 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks.jpg\" alt=\"Gloss_staff_picks\" width=\"478\" height=\"986\" srcset=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks.jpg 478w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Gloss_staff_picks-145x300.jpg 145w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 478px) 100vw, 478px\" \/><\/a><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\